# EEVEE's shadow-tile shape: a GS routes each triangle to one of 4 viewports (gl_ViewportIndex); the
# viewports differ in place, size, sign of height and depth range, the scissors cut them
draw plain count 24 instances 2
topology triangles
vb 0 stride 8 rate vertex data floats
attr 0 binding 0 format R32G32_FLOAT offset 0
viewport 0 0 0 32 32 0 1
viewport 1 32 0 32 24 0.2 0.6
viewport 2 0 64 30 -30 0 1
viewport 3 36 36 20 26 1 0
scissor 0 0 0 32 32
scissor 1 34 2 30 20
scissor 2 0 32 24 32
scissor 3 40 40 24 24
